# Render masters. ProRes at 176 Mbit/s — 1.4 GB for 70 seconds, which is what an
# editing codec is for. GitHub rejects any blob over 100 MB, so one of these in a
# commit makes the whole push unpushable. What ships is public/shots/*.mp4 at 0.5
# Mbit/s, 345x smaller with nothing visible lost. Rebuild with `npm run render`.
renders/
*.mov
*.prores.mp4
